---

SDK Goals

The SDK should enable developers to create new plugins quickly without understanding the internals of Ohira.

A new plugin should be possible to scaffold and run within minutes.


---

Guiding Principle

> "The Core provides the platform. The community provides the knowledge."



This philosophy ensures that Ohira can grow to support hundreds of technologies without making the Core Engine large or difficult to maintain.


